        <mxCell id="examplebody" value="Estimated mileage: 10,000 miles&#10;Advance paid: £300&#10;&#10;Actual 12,000 → final tax £360&#10;Additional payment: £60&#10;&#10;Actual 8,000 → final tax £240&#10;Refund: £60&#10;&#10;Actual 10,000 → no adjustment&#10;&#10;Readings match the billing period." style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=17;fontColor=#17324D;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;strokeWidth=1.5;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=12;text;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
